sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Invoice as Invoice
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Invoice: recordCreditMemo(creditAmount, creditMemoId)
    Note over Invoice: Policies: invoiceRead, invoiceWrite, invoiceExecute
    Note over Invoice: Guards (2)
    Invoice->>Invoice: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;paid#quot;
    Invoice->>Invoice: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Invoice->>Invoice: compute.priorCreditMemoAmount
    Invoice->>Invoice: compute.nextCreditMemoAmount
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.creditMemoAmount
    Invoice->>EventBus: emit InvoiceCreditMemoRecorded on invoice.credit_memo_recorded
    Invoice-->>-Client: void